    "Description": "This is a kernel live patch module which can be loaded by the kpatch command line utility to modify the code of a running kernel.  This patch module is targeted for kernel-5.14.0-570.17.1.el9_6.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* kernel: vmxnet3: Fix malformed packet sizing in vmxnet3_process_xdp (CVE-2025-37799)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
